  "ruleText": "Plc 1807.08 Renewing or Reinstating a Certification After Expiration, Suspension, or Revocation. The procedures in Plc 312 shall govern the renewal or reinstatement of a certification after expiration, suspension, or revocation.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
